                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "interesting take on a puzzle game not that i have played many like this.\n\nPROs\n- simple levels to start, leading to harder and harder levels\n- good storyline\n- nice spacey/creepy music\n- large enviroments and scenery with attention to detail\n\nCONs\n- some levels are 'to the wire' and very early on\n- others can be too simple or needless (short level to teach you about the next level)\n- movement feels floaty and tempermental\n\nOverall 8.5/10",
